# Root Module Overview
# modules/subnet/  → Reusable subnet module
# modules/oke/     → Reusable OKE module
# network.tf       → VCN, gateways, subnet module calls
# oke.tf           → OKE module call
# storage.tf       → Block volume
# kubernetes.tf    → K8s manifests
# datasources.tf   → Data sources
# locals.tf        → Derived values
# variables.tf     → Input variables
# outputs.tf       → Output values
# provider.tf      → OCI provider
# versions.tf      → Version constraints
